{"_registry_schema":"qlib-experiment-index-v3","_archive_kind":"strategy","exp_id":"regime-adapt/m0h20es-all-top25d5h5-bt","date":"2026-08-21","state":"completed","phase":"S","direction":"phase-m-v1-bt","report_kind":"phase_m_v1_bt","display_name":"M0 H20 ES top25 drop5 hold5（主格阶梯等价）","baseline_ref":"baseline/phase-m-v1-bt-v2","conclusion":"假设不成立。全期 +24.6%/夏普 0.99/回撤 −34.1%，比 BT v2（+23.1%/0.86/−39.2%）稳，但 2026 从 +13.6% 掉到 −1.5%；算术口径 2026 只有 +2.0%，对主格 k5h5 的 +37.9% 差 36pp，是四个执行方案里最大的。直接原因（diag_entry_rank 实测）：25 槽占满后「未持有的最高分」在 2025/2026 中位名次 6~7、最差 18，入场篮子实际是 top20 而不是 top5；评估 head-k 阶梯显示 k=5→15 在 2026 本身就要付 7.6pp（+37.9%→+30.3%），剩余约 28pp 仍未归因。集中度不是 2026 缺口的主因，已排除。未晋升。","detail_path":"strategies/regime-adapt/m0h20es-all-top25d5h5-bt/records/140fc9686d96f805efdd486a1dff6816b17fcdfe817c8bdc6d36108a7c683042.json","detail_sha256":"140fc9686d96f805efdd486a1dff6816b17fcdfe817c8bdc6d36108a7c683042"}
